      "file": "shared/f6dde15e48854ee3.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "say"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "6cf202e84e0e4251",
      "text": "An orange sphere joins the orbit.",
      "file": "shared/6cf202e84e0e4251.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "describe"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "382ed647e695aae4",
      "text": "Moon.",
      "file": "shared/382ed647e695aae4.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "say"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d8307f03d440ff8d",
      "text": "A silver sphere completes the ring of seven, all circling you.",
      "file": "shared/d8307f03d440ff8d.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "describe"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "d1fb019ed6aa6cab",
      "text": "Beyond the seven.",
      "file": "shared/d1fb019ed6aa6cab.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "say"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "4b7644ee6d55a175",
      "text": "Far behind the Chaos Star a black sphere rises with a shifting, many-colored corona.",
      "file": "shared/4b7644ee6d55a175.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "describe"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "b20037a2049e88b6",
      "text": "Look up. The rift opens.",
      "file": "shared/b20037a2049e88b6.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "say"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "53945e2c71a12323",
      "text": "Above you a glowing tear opens in the sky and a long shimmering serpent of shifting color flows out of it, stretching from East to West overhead.",
      "file": "shared/53945e2c71a12323.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "describe"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "8fbeffbc66191c60",
      "text": "Oo-rah-nos. Zah-kah-reth. Ee-oh-nar. Khal-ah-thoo.",
      "file": "shared/8fbeffbc66191c60.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "say"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "275f947d197dc00b",
      "text": "The serpent writhes faster and brighter, and the seven planets speed up around you.",
      "file": "shared/275f947d197dc00b.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "describe"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e13eb5ce12c7d58d",
      "text": "Stand as the eighth.",
      "file": "shared/e13eb5ce12c7d58d.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "say"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "0e47182b212f3238",
      "text": "The serpent coils overhead and the dark sun's corona swells.",
      "file": "shared/0e47182b212f3238.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "describe"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "f8c0fbaafdd87710",
      "text": "Remain.",
      "file": "shared/f8c0fbaafdd87710.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "say"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "5c551cdf947a52eb",
      "text": "The serpent returns.",
      "file": "shared/5c551cdf947a52eb.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "say"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ab7fb95412da80bc",
      "text": "The serpent withdraws into the glowing tear, which fades.",
      "file": "shared/ab7fb95412da80bc.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "describe"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "0efaa6c24fa1bf25",
      "text": "The seven go home.",
      "file": "shared/0efaa6c24fa1bf25.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "say"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e02b013e5d083747",
      "text": "The planets rise away and fade, and the black sphere shrinks to nothing.",
      "file": "shared/e02b013e5d083747.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "describe"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "9992b8148254b399",
      "text": "Laugh.",
      "file": "shared/9992b8148254b399.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "say"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "47a1cf0b96ccc19f",
      "text": "The Chaos Star flares and fades, and sparks scatter from the center.",
      "file": "shared/47a1cf0b96ccc19f.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "describe"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    },
    {
      "id": "231350c888af3fa5",
      "text": "Return.",
      "file": "shared/231350c888af3fa5.mp3",
      "uses": [
        {
          "ritual": "ouranos-chaos-star",
          "field": "say"
        }
      ],
      "dynamic": false
    }
  ]
